  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Intervention to strengthen low-and middle-income country primary care: proposal development for a cross-country comparison</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">With this award, we aimed to build a cross-country research collaboration of academic, ministry of health and technical support partners who are all engaged in implementing the PACK (Practical Approach to Care Kit) programme, a health system strengthening strategy, to support primary care reforms in their countries. Together we planned to build our research capacity and design a cross-country study of PACK implementation experiences.</narrative>
  </description>
